<!-- ───────────── Modules ───────────── -->
<section class="sec" id="modules">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="kicker">Modules</span>
      <h2>Everything a school runs on, in one place</h2>
      <p>Take only what your school needs. Switch a module on when you are ready for it; one you do not use never gets in the way.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mods">
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c1"><i class="bx bx-user-plus"></i></span><h3>Admissions</h3><p>Enquiry, follow-ups, registration and admission in one flow. Admission form, documents, ID cards.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c2"><i class="bx bx-wallet"></i></span><h3>Fees &amp; receipts</h3><p>Fee structure per class, collect at the counter, instant receipts, concessions, month-wise dues, day close.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c3"><i class="bx bx-calendar-check"></i></span><h3>Attendance</h3><p>Class teachers mark in seconds on the phone. Absent students' parents get a WhatsApp alert.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c4"><i class="bx bx-medal"></i></span><h3>Exams &amp; results</h3><p>Datesheet, admit cards, marks entry by subject teacher, grades, ranks and printable report cards.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c5"><i class="bx bx-time-five"></i></span><h3>Timetable &amp; homework</h3><p>Clash-free timetable, substitutes for absent teachers, the school bell, and homework with who-did-it.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c6"><i class="bx bx-group"></i></span><h3>Staff &amp; salary</h3><p>Staff records, staff attendance, leave, monthly salary and payslips that staff can open themselves.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c7"><i class="bx bx-bus"></i></span><h3>Transport</h3><p>Routes, stops, vehicles and riders, with transport fee added to the child's fees automatically.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c8"><i class="bx bx-package"></i></span><h3>School store</h3><p>Books, uniform and stationery: purchase, stock, issue to students and sale with receipts.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c9"><i class="bx bx-line-chart"></i></span><h3>Accounts</h3><p>Expenses by category and a cash book, next to your fee collection, so the day's money adds up.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c10"><i class="bx bx-certification"></i></span><h3>Certificates &amp; TC</h3><p>Transfer certificates, bonafide and character certificates printed with the school's seal and signature.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c11"><i class="bx bx-bell"></i></span><h3>Notices &amp; calendar</h3><p>Notice board for staff and parents, holidays and events on the school calendar.</p></article>
      <article class="mod"><span class="mi c12"><i class="bx bx-lock-alt"></i></span><h3>Roles &amp; permissions</h3><p>Principal, accountant, teacher, front desk: each sees only what their job needs.</p></article>
