</section>

<!-- ───────────── Why us ───────────── -->
<section class="sec sec-dark" id="why">
  <div class="wrap why">
    <div class="why-text">
      <span class="kicker kicker-l">Why SmartSchoolWala</span>
      <h2>Built the way a real school office works</h2>
      <p>We sat with school offices before writing a line: how fees are actually collected at the counter, how a class teacher marks attendance between periods, how results go out. The software follows that, so your staff do not have to change how they work.</p>
      <a href="@demoLink" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See it on your own data<i class="bx bx-right-arrow-alt"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card"><i class="bx bx-mobile-alt"></i><h3>Phone first</h3><p>Teachers mark attendance and enter marks from their phone. Install it on the home screen like an app.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><i class="bx bxl-whatsapp"></i><h3>Parents stay informed</h3><p>Absent alerts, fee reminders and notices reach parents on WhatsApp.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><i class="bx bx-shield-quarter"></i><h3>Safe and private</h3><p>Each school's data is kept apart, student photos open only for your staff, and every role sees only its part.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><i class="bx bx-receipt"></i><h3>Money that adds up</h3><p>Every receipt is numbered, cancellations need a reason, and the day close shows what each counter collected.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ───────────── Getting started ───────────── -->
<section class="sec" id="switch">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="kicker">Getting started</span>
      <h2>From your registers to live in days, not months</h2>
      <p>No need to type in every student again. We bring your existing data over and stay with you until your office is comfortable.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><span>1</span><h3>Free demo</h3><p>We show you the system with a sample school, on a call or at your school.</p></li>
      <li><span>2</span><h3>Your data comes in</h3><p>Students, staff and old dues are imported from Excel and checked row by row.</p></li>
      <li><span>3</span><h3>Setup &amp; training</h3><p>Classes, fee structure and timetable set up together; your staff are trained.</p></li>
      <li><span>4</span><h3>Go live</h3><p>Start collecting fees and marking attendance. We are a call away when you need us.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ───────────── FAQ ───────────── -->
<section class="sec sec-soft" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq-wrap">
    <div class="sec-head left">
      <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
      <h2>Questions schools ask us</h2>
      <p>Anything else? Ask us on the demo call.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>How much does it cost?<i class="bx bx-chevron-down"></i></summary><p>The price depends on the number of students and the modules your school takes. Book a free demo and we will send you a quote for your school.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do we need to install anything?<i class="bx bx-chevron-down"></i></summary><p>No. It opens in the browser on any computer or phone. On a phone you can add it to the home screen and use it like an app.</p></details>
      <details><summary>We already have our data in Excel. Do we type it again?<i class="bx bx-chevron-down"></i></summary><p>No. Students, staff and previous dues are imported from Excel. Every row is checked first, and nothing is saved until you confirm.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can a teacher see fees or salaries?<i class="bx bx-chevron-down"></i></summary><p>Only if you allow it. Every role has its own permissions: a teacher sees their classes, the accountant sees fees, and salary stays with whoever you choose.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is our data safe?<i class="bx bx-chevron-down"></i></summary><p>Each school's data is kept separate from every other school's. Sign-in is by password, photos and documents open only for your signed-in staff, and every receipt records who collected it.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can we start with only fees and add the rest later?<i class="bx bx-chevron-down"></i></summary><p>Yes. Modules are switched on per school, so you can begin with what you need most and add others whenever you are ready.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

